Package: jarvis-session
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Muhammad AbdElHay <mmAbdelhay@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: labwc
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @DISTRO_NAME@ and classic Wayland sessions with automatic fallback
 Login-screen entries for the full @DISTRO_NAME@ session and the classic
 desktop. In the full session, when the Jarvis shell fails three times
 within a minute, the session switches to the
 classic desktop on its own.
